# No Third-Party Tool Contributors

Never add third-party coding tools (Devin, Claude, Copilot, Cursor, etc.) as contributors or co-authors in git commits.

- Do NOT include `Co-Authored-By` trailers for any AI tool or bot
- Do NOT include `Generated with [Tool]` lines in commit messages
- Commits should only attribute the human developer
